      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "部署关系：rclone-google-drive.service 先挂载 → Java systemd 服务启动；Java 需要写 nas-runtime 与 /etc/nginx/pdfbrowser-auth。",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "部署关系：rclone-google-drive.service 先挂载 → Java systemd 服务启动；Java 需要写 nas-runtime 与 /etc/nginx/pdfbrowser-auth。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "text_0135",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 90,
      "y": 1160,
      "width": 4320,
      "height": 37.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#9775fa",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1169065,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 682085,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788220800000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 30,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "② 凭据、密码修改与持久化边界",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "② 凭据、密码修改与持久化边界",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "text_0136",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 90,
      "y": 1200,
      "width": 4320,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#5f6b7a",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1176984,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 685656,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788220800000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "网站登录密码是不可逆 BCrypt；远程存储密码是可逆 AES-GCM 密文，密钥与密文分离。两者都只应存在于部署服务器。",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "网站登录密码是不可逆 BCrypt；远程存储密码是可逆 AES-GCM 密文，密钥与密文分离。两者都只应存在于部署服务器。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "text_0138",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 184,
      "y": 1314,
      "width": 672,
      "height": 26.25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#7048e8",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": null,
