      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788220800000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "每行：username : BCrypt hash\n用户名明文；密码不保存明文\nBCrypt strength = 12\n默认可由 PDFBROWSER_HTPASSWD_FILE 覆盖",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "每行：username : BCrypt hash\n用户名明文；密码不保存明文\nBCrypt strength = 12\n默认可由 PDFBROWSER_HTPASSWD_FILE 覆盖",
