      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "当前生产主链：Browser → Nginx → Vue/Spring → rclone/FUSE → Google Drive/NAS\n独立分析链：Client → Go → Rust → DOC_ROOT。若要合流，核心工作是补 Spring 任务边界、持久化状态、Go 调用与前端状态反馈。",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "当前生产主链：Browser → Nginx → Vue/Spring → rclone/FUSE → Google Drive/NAS\n独立分析链：Client → Go → Rust → DOC_ROOT。若要合流，核心工作是补 Spring 任务边界、持久化状态、Go 调用与前端状态反馈。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.28
    },
